{
  "version": "1.0",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "whenToUse": "Narrative explanation, framing sentence, or any prose paragraph.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"text\", \"id\": \"...\", \"content\": \"...\" }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Correlation measures how two assets move together."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "kpi_row",
      "whenToUse": "A row of key metrics / headline numbers the user should see at a glance.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"kpi_row\", \"id\": \"...\", \"items\": [ { \"label\": \"...\", \"value\": \"...\", \"tone\": \"positive|neutral|negative\" }, ... ] }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "kpi_row",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Return",
            "value": "8.2%",
            "tone": "positive"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "whenToUse": "Trends, comparisons, correlation matrices, or composition. Pick the kind that fits the data.",
      "kinds": [
        "line",
        "bar",
        "hbar",
        "area",
        "scatter",
        "stacked",
        "combo",
        "heatmap",
        "pie",
        "donut",
        "funnel",
        "gauge",
        "radar",
        "candlestick",
        "waterfall",
        "treemap",
        "sunburst",
        "sankey",
        "graph",
        "boxplot",
        "bubble",
        "histogram"
      ],
      "spec": [
        "Pick \"kind\" to fit the data; ONLY these kinds render:",
        "- line | bar | hbar | area | stacked | combo (CATEGORICAL x-axis) -> you MUST give \"x_categories\" (the real labels) and each series as PLAIN NUMBERS aligned to them. NEVER use bare 0,1,2 as x.",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"title\": \"...\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"bar\", \"x_label\": \"Segment\", \"y_label\": \"USD B\", \"x_categories\": [\"Data Center\", \"Gaming\", \"Auto\"], \"series\": [ { \"name\": \"FY2024\", \"color\": \"green\", \"values\": [47.5, 10.4, 1.1] }, { \"name\": \"FY2023\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"values\": [15.0, 9.1, 0.9] } ] } }",
        "  (values[i] pairs with x_categories[i]; one series per group, e.g. one per year. For combo, add \"kind\":\"bar\"|\"line\" per series.)",
        "  Optional per series: \"color\" (named like blue/green/red/teal/purple or a hex like \"#2563eb\"). Pick clear, distinct colors; if omitted a default palette is used.",
        "- scatter (numeric x vs y / correlation) -> series with [x, y] pairs (no x_categories).",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"scatter\", \"series\": [ { \"name\": \"...\", \"values\": [ [x, y], ... ] } ] } }",
        "- heatmap (correlation matrix, confusion matrix, any grid of values) -> labels + a 2D \"matrix\" (rows = y_labels, cols = x_labels):",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"title\": \"...\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"heatmap\", \"x_labels\": [\"A\",\"B\"], \"y_labels\": [\"A\",\"B\"], \"matrix\": [ [1, 0.3], [0.3, 1] ] } }",
        "- pie | donut | treemap | sunburst (composition / share / hierarchy) -> use \"items\":",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"title\": \"...\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"pie|donut|treemap|sunburst\", \"items\": [ { \"label\": \"...\", \"value\": 42 }, ... ] } }",
        "- waterfall (P&L bridge / cash-flow walk / variance) -> use \"items\" where each value is the DELTA (+/-):",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"title\": \"...\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"waterfall\", \"items\": [ { \"label\": \"Start\", \"value\": 100 }, { \"label\": \"Sales\", \"value\": 30 }, { \"label\": \"Costs\", \"value\": -20 } ] } }",
        "- candlestick (OHLC price) -> \"x_categories\" (dates) + \"candles\" of [open, close, low, high]:",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"candlestick\", \"x_categories\": [\"2024-01\",\"2024-02\"], \"candles\": [ [120,135,118,138], [135,130,128,140] ] } }",
        "- boxplot (distribution / quartiles) -> \"x_categories\" + \"boxes\" of [min, q1, median, q3, max]:",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"boxplot\", \"x_categories\": [\"Fund A\",\"Fund B\"], \"boxes\": [ [-5,2,6,9,15], [-2,3,5,8,12] ] } }",
        "- bubble (x vs y with size) -> series with [x, y, size] triples:",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"bubble\", \"x_label\": \"Risk\", \"y_label\": \"Return\", \"series\": [ { \"name\": \"Funds\", \"values\": [ [8,12,500], [14,18,1200] ] } ] } }",
        "- sankey | graph (flows / network) -> \"nodes\" + \"links\":",
        "  { \"type\": \"chart\", \"chart\": { \"kind\": \"sankey\", \"nodes\": [ {\"name\":\"Revenue\"}, {\"name\":\"COGS\"}, {\"name\":\"Gross Profit\"} ], \"links\": [ {\"source\":\"Revenue\",\"target\":\"COGS\",\"value\":40}, {\"source\":\"Revenue\",\"target\":\"Gross Profit\",\"value\":60} ] } }",
        "- histogram (frequency) -> like bar: \"x_categories\" (bins) + one series of counts.",
        "For a correlation matrix you MUST use kind \"heatmap\" with \"matrix\" (never a line/bar series)."
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "chart",
        "title": "Correlation",
        "chart": {
          "kind": "heatmap",
          "x_labels": [
            "A",
            "B"
          ],
          "y_labels": [
            "A",
            "B"
          ],
          "matrix": [
            [
              1,
              0.3
            ],
            [
              0.3,
              1
            ]
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "whenToUse": "Tabular breakdown or side-by-side comparison of rows and columns.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\", \"columns\": [ ... ], \"rows\": [ [ ... ], ... ] }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "table",
        "columns": [
          "Option",
          "Cost"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "A",
            10
          ],
          [
            "B",
            20
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "action_row",
      "whenToUse": "Suggested follow-up actions / next prompts as buttons.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"action_row\", \"id\": \"...\", \"buttons\": [ { \"id\": \"...\", \"label\": \"...\", \"intent\": \"...\" }, ... ] }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "action_row",
        "buttons": [
          {
            "label": "Show risks",
            "intent": "show_risks"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "whenToUse": "Photo, diagram, illustration, or icon via an https URL or data URI.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"image\", \"id\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\", \"src\": \"https://... OR data:image/png;base64,...\", \"alt\": \"accessible description\", \"caption\": \"optional caption\", \"fit\": \"contain|cover\" }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "https://...",
        "alt": "diagram"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat_card",
      "whenToUse": "Prominent headline metric cards — a few key figures shown large (label + value + optional subtext + tone).",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"stat_card\", \"items\": [ { \"label\": \"...\", \"value\": \"...\", \"subtext\": \"optional\", \"tone\": \"success|warning|danger|info|default\" }, ... ] }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "stat_card",
        "items": [
          { "label": "FY2023 Revenue", "value": "$383.3B", "subtext": "down 3% YoY", "tone": "warning" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "progress",
      "whenToUse": "Percentage / progress bars (value vs max) — margins, allocations, % of target.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"progress\", \"items\": [ { \"label\": \"...\", \"value\": 44.1, \"max\": 100, \"tone\": \"emerald|amber|red|cyan|indigo\" }, ... ] }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "progress",
        "items": [
          { "label": "Gross margin", "value": 44.1, "max": 100, "tone": "emerald" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "badge_row",
      "whenToUse": "A row of small status pills (label + tone) — flags, statuses, tags.",
      "spec": [
        "{ \"type\": \"badge_row\", \"items\": [ { \"label\": \"...\", \"tone\": \"default|success|warning|danger|info\" }, ... ] }"
      ],
      "example": {
        "type": "badge_row",
        "items": [
          { "label": "Profitable", "tone": "success" },
          { "label": "Revenue down", "tone": "danger" }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}